{% comment %}
  The words on the product gallery photos. Each photo carries one idea, in the
  order a first-time buyer asks their questions:

    hero    1  What is it?             the bottle, the three things it is not
    three   2  Is 3 worth it?          three places a bottle lives; the third is free
    aha     3  Why does it work?       sweat doesn't smell, bacteria do
    howto   4  How do I use it?        spray, dry, dress
            5  Better than roll-on?    the drawn chart (vura-proof-slide)
    reviews 6  Do people like it?      live Judge.me rating + two verified quotes
    scale   7  How big is it?          50 ml, sangeet to Monday
    nani    8  Can I trust it?         the crystal from nani's sink, now a mist
    inside  9  What's in it?           the four ingredients that do the work
    gift    10 Anything else?          a gift, and when it arrives

  The text is drawn by the theme over the photo, so Google Shopping and the Meta
  catalogue still receive clean product images. Every claim here is one the
  product page already makes (FAQ, ingredients, How it works). Do not add
  "all day", "stops sweat" or "aluminium-free".

  Text that belongs together sits in one block (.vn-stack, .vn-panel) so it
  grows with the copy and never overlaps itself on a narrow phone.

  Matched by image file name in product-thumbnail. The reviews slide is not a
  product image; product-media-gallery inserts it after the chart.

  Accepts:
  - key: {String} one of the keys above
  - product: {Object} needed for the live rating on 'reviews'
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign hold = 5000
  case key
    when 'hero'
      assign hold = 4500
    when 'aha', 'inside'
      assign hold = 6500
    when 'howto', 'reviews', 'nani'
      assign hold = 6000
  endcase
-%}
<div class="vn vn--{{ key }}" data-vura-note data-hold="{{ hold }}">
  {%- case key -%}
    {%- when 'hero' -%}
      <div class="vn-stack vn-shadow" style="left:4.8%; top:4.6%;">
        <p class="vn-eyebrow">Fitkari (alum) underarm mist</p>
        <p class="vn-h vn-cream" style="margin-top:.3em;">50 ml of the<br>real thing.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-cream vn-shadow" style="left:4.4%; top:55%; transform:rotate(-4deg);">that's real<br>fitkari</p>
      <svg class="vn-mark" style="left:11%; top:64.5%; width:11%;" viewBox="0 0 60 70" aria-hidden="true"><path class="vn-draw" pathLength="1" d="M8 4 C 2 24, 10 44, 30 58"/><path class="vn-draw vn-draw--late" pathLength="1" d="M18 56 L31 59 L29 46"/></svg>
      <div class="vn-chips" style="left:3%; right:3%; bottom:4%;">
        <span class="vn-chip">No alcohol</span><span class="vn-chip">No synthetic fragrance</span><span class="vn-chip">No white marks</span>
      </div>

    {%- when 'three' -%}
      <div class="vn-fade vn-fade--dark"></div>
      <div class="vn-stack vn-shadow" style="left:4.4%; top:3.6%; right:4%;">
        <p class="vn-h vn-cream">Three bottles. Six months of fresh.</p>
        <p class="vn-s vn-cream" style="margin-top:.35em; opacity:.92;">One bottle lasts about 2 months of daily use</p>
      </div>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-tag" style="right:3.2%; top:17%; transform:rotate(4deg);">this one's on us</p>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-cream vn-shadow vn-center" style="left:23%; bottom:5.5%;">home</p>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-cream vn-shadow vn-center" style="left:50%; bottom:5.5%;">gym bag</p>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-cream vn-shadow vn-center" style="left:76.5%; bottom:5.5%;">office</p>

    {%- when 'aha' -%}
      <div class="vn-card" style="right:3%; top:2.6%; width:56%;">
        <p class="vn-h vn-cream">Sweat doesn't smell.<br><span class="vn-saffron">Bacteria do.</span></p>
        <p class="vn-b vn-cream" style="margin-top:.6em;">Fitkari makes it hard for them to grow. You still sweat. The smell just never starts.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-paper" style="left:4%; bottom:17.8%; transform:rotate(-4deg);">this is fitkari<br>(potash alum)</p>
      <svg class="vn-mark vn-mark--cream" style="left:10.7%; top:84.8%; width:11%;" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true"><path class="vn-draw" pathLength="1" d="M10 2 C 6 20, 12 34, 30 46"/><path class="vn-draw vn-draw--late" pathLength="1" d="M18 46 L31 47 L28 34"/></svg>

    {%- when 'howto' -%}
      <p class="vn-hand vn-cream vn-shadow" style="right:4%; top:4%; text-align:right; transform:rotate(-3deg);">gentle enough for<br>right after shaving</p>
      <div class="vn-panel vn-panel--forest">
        <p class="vn-h vn-cream">Spray. Dry. Dress.</p>
        <div class="vn-steps">
          <div><span class="vn-hand vn-saffron vn-num">1</span><span class="vn-b vn-cream">2–3 sprays on clean, dry underarms</span></div>
          <div><span class="vn-hand vn-saffron vn-num">2</span><span class="vn-b vn-cream">Let it air-dry. Nothing to rub in.</span></div>
          <div><span class="vn-hand vn-saffron vn-num">3</span><span class="vn-b vn-cream">Get dressed. No white marks.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    {%- when 'reviews' -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | default: 5
        assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count | default: 0
      -%}
      <div class="vn-bg" style="background-image:url('{{ 'vura-gallery-reviews-bg.webp' | asset_url }}');"></div>
      <div class="vn-stack" style="left:6.3%; right:6.3%; top:6.6%;">
        <div class="vn-stars" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 1.6l2.6 5.3 5.8.8-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8L1.6 7.7l5.8-.8z"/></svg>{%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <p class="vn-s vn-cream vn-caps" style="margin-top:.7em;">{{ rating | round: 1 }} · {{ rating_count }} reviews</p>
        <p class="vn-q vn-cream" style="margin-top:.55em;">“Lightweight, dries quickly, and feels very gentle on my skin.”</p>
        <p class="vn-s vn-cream" style="margin-top:.7em; opacity:.85;">Pranjal · verified buyer</p>
        <div class="vn-rule" style="margin:4.2cqw 30% 4.2cqw 0;"></div>
        <p class="vn-hand vn-saffron vn-hand--lg">“Changed my entire routine!”</p>
        <p class="vn-s vn-cream" style="margin-top:.5em; opacity:.85;">Akhil · verified buyer</p>
      </div>
      <p class="vn-s vn-cream" style="left:6.3%; bottom:5.6%; opacity:.7;">Every review is further down this page</p>

    {%- when 'scale' -%}
      <div class="vn-card vn-card--paper" style="left:3.3%; top:3.3%;">
        <p class="vn-h vn-forest">Sangeet-ready.<br>Monday-ready.</p>
        <p class="vn-b vn-forest vn-bold" style="margin-top:.5em;">50 ml. Fits a clutch,<br>a gym bag, a cabin bag.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-paper vn-hand--lg" style="left:74.8%; top:68.9%; transform:rotate(-8deg);">50 ml</p>

    {%- when 'nani' -%}
      <p class="vn-h vn-paper-box" style="left:4.8%; top:4%;">Your nani kept it<br>by the sink.</p>
      <p class="vn-hand vn-paper vn-paper--rust" style="right:5.2%; top:36.7%; transform:rotate(6deg);">nani-approved <svg class="vn-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 20" aria-hidden="true"><path class="vn-draw vn-draw--late" pathLength="1" d="M3 11 L9 17 L21 3"/></svg></p>
      <div class="vn-panel vn-panel--cream">
        <p class="vn-b vn-forest vn-bold">No more rubbing a wet crystal. We turned fitkari into a fine mist, so nothing touches your skin but the spray.</p>
      </div>

    {%- when 'inside' -%}
      <div class="vn-fade vn-fade--left"></div>
      <div class="vn-stack vn-shadow" style="left:4.8%; top:4.6%; width:36%;">
        <p class="vn-h vn-cream">Four things<br>do the work.</p>
        <div class="vn-list">
          <p><b class="vn-saffron">Fitkari</b><br>calms odour bacteria</p>
          <p><b class="vn-saffron">Damask rose water</b><br>tones and refreshes</p>
          <p><b class="vn-saffron">Aloe vera</b><br>soothes, even after shaving</p>
          <p><b class="vn-saffron">Glycerin</b><br>keeps skin soft</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vn-panel vn-panel--bar">
        <p class="vn-b vn-cream">No alcohol. No synthetic fragrance: a trace of real rose oil is the only scent. <span class="vn-saffron">Full formula below</span></p>
      </div>

    {%- when 'gift' -%}
      <div class="vn-panel vn-panel--cream">
        <p class="vn-h vn-forest">A gift that says “I care”.<br><span class="vn-rust">Not “you smell”.</span></p>
        <p class="vn-b vn-forest vn-bold" style="margin-top:.55em;">Ships in 1–2 days · Free delivery in 4–7 days</p>
      </div>
  {%- endcase -%}
</div>
